 "confidence": "medium",
 "notes": "Iridescent blue neck/breast (scale texture), green-bronze back, barred buff wing coverts, chestnut primaries, crest of bare shafts with blue tips, white stripes above and below the eye. Train = ~110 coverts from the rump, tips spread along a trailing path to the ground; longer feathers drawn first so shorter feathers' eyespots form staggered rows. Train length about 2.3x the bird's standing height. Authored facing left.",
